ommon markets and economic unions"}], "description": "Regional agreements differ in depth and business impact."}, {"id": "9db24cba-47a8-42c8-a189-e8ced12babc5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Major blocs", "children": [{"id": "51420570-7a66-4cff-9734-291495b30605", "type": "concept", "title": "European Union"}, {"id": "7d6ac566-a906-4c94-ad20-a4a0146be4e4", "type": "concept", "title": "USMCA"}, {"id": "d3a6e0fd-72a5-4cff-a94e-74f654e10f06", "type": "concept", "title": "ASEAN and regional Asia"}], "description": "Students compare integration models and their strategic consequences."}, {"id": "948b1686-09c1-4485-90a4-d1bd22f405b1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Business implications", "children": [{"id": "affeadd9-71fe-4f34-9102-dcd69170e2da", "type": "concept", "title": "Rules of origin"}, {"id": "04790c8d-05b1-4cec-9d3b-8ccccd9555c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Regulatory harmonization"}, {"id": "dbd207bc-fb11-46c9-9231-f362a7895e11", "type": "concept", "title": "Market access strategy"}], "description": "Trade agreements affect sourcing, pricing, compliance, and location choice."}]}, {"id": "084cfe0c-5ee3-4f76-9654-171e16b59f7b", "type": "topic", "title": "Foreign Exchange, International Finance, and Cross-Border Exposure", "description": "This module connects exchange rates, capital flows, currency regimes, and hedging to firm-level decisions.", "children": [{"id": "8f1a3192-9a9b-48a5-90b2-7fc62e3963b5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Exchange-rate basics", "children": [{"id": "136a6d8f-33ab-411c-91da-13bf3cacf851", "type": "concept", "title": "Spot and forward rates"}, {"id": "c6cf9d5a-7278-45ca-b1e4-34e4ce173286", "type": "concept", "title": "Appreciation and depreciation"}, {"id": "dd31bce2-c599-45de-8dc5-7c3d8643a56b", "type": "concept", "title": "Currency regimes"}], "description": "Currency movements change revenues, costs, assets, and competitiveness."}, {"id": "7a5ce8ab-def4-4ed6-9848-0da30b852a78", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Exposure types", "children"